sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as HTTP Client (Student)
    participant Nest as NestJS API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL (Primary)
    participant Redis as Redis (BullMQ)
    participant Mongo as MongoDB (Audit Log)

    Note over Client,PG: 1. Concurrency Invariant Check
    Client->>Nest: POST /courses/:id/enroll
    Nest->>PG: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Nest->>PG: SELECT * FROM course_sections WHERE id = :id FOR UPDATE
    Note over PG: Exclusive row lock acquired.<br/>Concurrent requests for this row block here.
    PG-->>Nest: Section record (available_seats: 1)
    
    alt Seats Available
        Nest->>PG: UPDATE course_sections SET available_seats = available_seats - 1
        Nest->>PG: INSERT INTO enrollments (user_id, section_id)
        Nest->>PG: INSERT INTO outbox_events (event_type, payload, status) VALUES ('ENROLLED', ..., 'PENDING')
        Nest->>PG: COMMIT
        Note over PG: Lock released. Next queued request proceeds.
        Nest-->>Client: 201 Created (Enrolled)
    else Section Full
        Nest->>PG: ROLLBACK
        Nest-->>Client: 409 Conflict (Section Full)
    end

    Note over PG,Mongo: 2. Asynchronous Event Propagation
    loop Outbox Poller Worker
        Nest->>PG: SELECT * FROM outbox_events WHERE status = 'PENDING' LIMIT 50 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        Nest->>Redis: BullMQ.add('waitlist-promotion', payload)
        Nest->>Mongo: db.audit_logs.insertOne(payload)
        Nest->>PG: UPDATE outbox_events SET status = 'PROCESSED'
    end
